    },
    {
      "s": 41.99,
      "e": 44.14,
      "text": "and tell him he was headed to the big island."
    },
    {
      "s": 44.14,
      "e": 46.06,
      "text": "- [Nick] KK's always communicated very well"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.06,
      "e": 48.98,
